\periph Deuterocanon Introduction
\mt1 Deuterocanonicals/Apocrypha
\p Most of the documents gathered in this section were part of an ancient translation of the Hebrew Scriptures into Greek called the ‘Septuagint’ (also known as the ‘LXX’) which was widely read by Christians in the early church.
…

\periph New Testament Introduction
\mt1 The Messianic Update / New Testament
\p The documents making up the Messianic update to the Hebrew scriptures were written by the followers of Yeshua/Jesus the messiah/christ.
